    "created_at": "2016-05-31T08:02:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-31T08:02:16Z",
    "body": "Yes please let’s drop this requirement. We have plenty of evidence that it causes problems for authors without actually solving any problems for them:\n- http://stackoverflow.com/questions/31701253/how-to-fix-consecutive-hyphens-did-not-terminate-a-comment-error\n- https://twitter.com/search?f=tweets&vertical=default&q=Consecutive%20hyphens%20did%20not%20terminate%20a%20comment&src=typd\n\n(BTW I dunno what BEM is but I assume it must be some library or template thing or something that uses `--` in comments.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
